      <div style="font-size:0.76rem;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;max-width:360px;margin:0 auto;">You can use Butterfly Dynamix freely for now. When plans launch, you'll choose and manage your plan, payment method and invoices here — nothing will change on your account without your say-so.</div>
